      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Continuing with the agency form, Magüi and Paquita ask Mariona about her weight and any special skills like singing, dancing, horse riding, or fencing. Mariona reveals a knack for accents, and Paquita cheerfully decides to list her as an expert in fencing because she can learn it in two days. Listen to the Spanish first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "¿Peso?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Cincuenta y nueve.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Habilidades especiales?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "¿En plan qué?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Si cantas, bailas, un caballo, una esgrima...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Nada, hija? ¿Un verso?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Bueno, tengo facilidad para poner acento argentino.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Anótalo.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Me sale bien.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Pues mira, eso nos viene genial.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Tenemos mucho contacto con el mercado latino.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Ponle esgrima. Lo aprendes en dos días.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Y si te llaman, da tiempo. Experta te voy a poner.",
