    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "¿Peso?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Weight?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Cincuenta y nueve.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fifty-nine kilos.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Habilidades especiales?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Special skills?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "¿En plan qué?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Like what?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Si cantas, bailas, un caballo, una esgrima...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whether you sing, dance, ride a horse, do fencing...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Nada, hija? ¿Un verso?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing, sweetheart? Reciting verse?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Bueno, tengo facilidad para poner acento argentino.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, I have a knack for putting on an Argentine accent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Anótalo.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Write that down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mariona",
      "t": "Me sale bien.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It comes out well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Pues mira, eso nos viene genial.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well look, that suits us wonderfully.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Tenemos mucho contacto con el mercado latino.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have a lot of contact with the Latin American market.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Ponle esgrima. Lo aprendes en dos días.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Put down fencing for her. You can learn it in two days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Y si te llaman, da tiempo. Experta te voy a poner.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And if they call you, there's enough time. I'm going to put you down as an expert.'",
      "gap": 0.65
